==Release information==
This card was one of seven cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 9 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Ultra Beast Drop Event]], which ran from June 4 to 14, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*The '''Shoegaze''' attack is named after {{wp|shoegaze}}, a genre of music. The Japanese name of the attack, シューゲイザー ''Shoegazer'' (common name for the shoegaze genre in Japan), contains the same kana for ゲイザー ''gazer'' as フォトンゲイザー ''{{m|Photon Geyser}}'', {{p|Necrozma}}'s [[signature move]] in the [[core series games]].

